{"id": "t045-005", "text": "Noah & his partner Kieran just back from 2 wks in Vietnam. Noah's still jetlagged. Kieran wants to go back already. Hoi An was the highlight apparently, they did a cooking class and he's now obsessed w/ making pho at home. Noah's sister Zoe watched their dog Rolo while they were away and apparently he's put on weight. they're having ppl round for a Vietnamese dinner 15 Nov to show the photos. I'm invited, bring beer", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "2 wks in Vietnam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "jetlagged", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to go back", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "making pho", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Vietnamese dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 Nov", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring beer", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
